  "Often no reply within a day",
  "On 16 October 2026 the sources changed: eno.vn stopped importing listings from Batdongsan.com.vn, Muaban.net, Rever.vn and Honeycomb House, and dropped Nhatot.com listings flagged as company ads. On 20 October 2026 they changed again: eno.vn stopped listing homes from Nhatot.com and added GoPlus's own listings. Figures from before either date are not comparable with later ones.",
  "On a computer, click your name or photo at the bottom of the menu on the left.",
  "On an official partner’s listings and storefront, the partner badge takes the place of the score: it records a signed agreement with eno, not a track record.",
  "On an official partner’s listings, the partner badge takes the place of the score: it records a signed agreement with eno, not a track record.",
  "On another call — please wait",
  "On eno since {year}",
  "On eno.vn you browse apartments, houses, rooms and serviced flats in Ho Chi Minh City by district, and the eno team checks availability on up to five you pick, free.",
  "On guide and topic pages",
  "On iPhone and iPad, notifications work once eno is on your Home Screen: tap Share, then “Add to Home Screen”.",
  "On sale 23 October 2026",
  "On the home page",
  "On the home page, in the default order, at least two of the first four listings and four of the first twelve are second-hand goods for sale, when there are enough of them.",
  "On the home page, the feed, the Outstanding businesses and category rails, and the For You rail wherever it appears show only listings whose seller you contact through the platform’s own messaging. They leave out every listing whose button takes you to another website — linked listings from a source site, and listings booked or bought on a partner’s own website.",
  "On this page",
  "On track",
  "On-site",
  "Once a day we’ll ask you to confirm what’s still available — it keeps your offers fresh at the top.",
  "Once a week: the newest apartments and teachers. No spam.",
  "Once you sign in and allow it, your assistant can also post, message sellers and negotiate; every agent message is labelled 🤖 AI, and only you can accept an offer.",
  "Once you sign in, your answers are saved, so you can finish on a laptop.",
  "Once you type a query, matching what you asked for takes the lead — a trusted seller with the wrong item does not help you — but trust remains a heavyweight co-factor:",
  "One amount at a time: a range such as 15–20tr is refused.",
  "One last step: eno could not be removed from your Apple Account automatically. Please remove it yourself in your Apple Account settings, under Sign in with Apple.",
  "One line schools read first — at least 10 characters.",
  "One moment — I was still connecting. Say that again?",
